    "detailed_description": "\u201cDead By Murder\u201d, is a murder mystery strategy game, where the user plays as a police detective and must solve a series of homicide cases. <br />\r\nThe game has the look and feel of a black and white comic book. It is set in Los Angeles in 1945 and all the characters have the faces of Golden Age Hollywood stars.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Easy and fast paced gameplay.<br />\r\n- Unique game mechanics.<br />\r\n- Many original cases to solve.<br />\r\n- New cases can be added at anytime.<br />\r\n- A tribute to the old Hollywood gangster movies.",
